## Interface: 16001
## Title: Quest Item Tip
## Notes: Shows in an item's tooltip which quests the item belongs to - needed for, starts or handed out by a quest - and whether that quest is in your log, not started yet or already done. After a quest is handed in it asks whether to delete quest items that are left over. /qit
